Package: EarlyTProng1
Title: Educational Prong 1 Disease-to-Cancer Trajectory Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Cohort-agnostic R workflow to prepare EHR tables, estimate
    matched relative-risk disease-to-cancer trajectories, and plot RR versus
    mean diagnosis lag. Includes a seeded dummy-data generator for testing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    readr,
    yaml,
    jsonlite,
    optparse,
    stringr,
    MatchIt,
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    shiny
